<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="6c2138e1">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Gather leaders&apos; perceptions of the major enablers and barriers to achieving the change vision and perceived level
        of implementation risk.&amp;nbsp;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify Change management principles
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop Framework to conduct business engagement, readiness and adoption activities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Specify the primary change management approach across the program lifecycle
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Define key change evaluation and monitoring mechanisms to manage and assess on-going engagement
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify targeted leadership groups, sponsors and stakeholders identified
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop key milestones and solution integration points across the delivery plan
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Craft initial messages that need to be communicated by the leadership team to launch change activities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Assess how the change vision and case for change can be interpreted to the different stakeholder segments
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify resource requirements against the scope of engagement, readiness and adoption activities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify the skills and capabilities required from the business to support change management
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify associated tools/templates/other guidance material the client can leverage from previous initiatives
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="2b5ba797"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="e7765663"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="8b57e93a"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="23a24910">To&amp;nbsp;deepen the&amp;nbsp;understanding, set expectations and&amp;nbsp;build commitment among program and business
leadership&amp;nbsp;to the level of effort involved in managing change activities throughout the initiative lifecycle; to scope
change management services needed to enable the business solution.</attribute>
